268
00:14:47,833 --> 00:14:50,415
No, not at all. No.
ບໍ່, ບໍ່ເລີຍ. ບໍ່.

269
00:14:50,416 --> 00:14:52,207
I have no friends.
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ມີເພື່ອນ.

270
00:14:52,208 --> 00:14:53,624
No friends.
ບໍ່ມີເພື່ອນມິດ.

271
00:14:53,625 --> 00:14:55,874
Um, pets?
ອູມ, ສັດລ້ຽງບໍ?

272
00:14:55,875 --> 00:14:58,624
I identified
misleading profile photos
